  "description": "SCL (IEC 61850-6, tracked independently through Ed.2.0 / AMD1:2018 / AMD2:2024=Ed.2.2) XML parser/writer for ICD/CID/SCD/SSD files. Server side: builds the actual runtime DataModel from a configuration file. Client side: builds an expected/offline model used for configuration, validation, and comparison against the model actually discovered at runtime over MMS (GetDirectory/GetDataDirectory) -- SCL does not perform client-side model discovery itself, that happens over the wire, not from a file.",
